(59, '2026-01-05 14:58:37', 'mirab4feohdkl800v5', 'message', '{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"To link the &quot;Full 6 Days Tour Packages and logistics&quot; page with the Tour Package tabs, you need to edit the menu or the tab settings where the Tour Packages are managed. \\n\\nIf the tabs are managed via a menu:\\n- Go to the WordPress admin dashboard.\\n- Navigate to Appearance &gt; Menus.\\n- Find the menu used for the Tour Package tabs.\\n- Add the page &quot;Full 6 Days Tour Packages and logistics&quot; to this menu.\\n- Save the menu.\\n\\nIf the tabs are managed by a plugin or block:\\n- Edit the page or post where the Tour Package tabs appear.\\n- Locate the block or plugin settings for the tabs.\\n- Add or link the &quot;Full 6 Days Tour Packages and logistics&quot; page to the relevant tab.\\n- Update the page.\\n\\nThis will associate the page with the Tour Package tabs for easy navigation.\",\"followup\":\"\",\"pageSuggestion\":\"\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"agent1\",\"name\":\"Support Specialist\",\"role\":\"WordPress Expert\",\"avatar\":\"\"},\"sessionId\":\"b52f4465-8e7c-4c5a-9b22-237319971dd7\"}', 1),
