(110, '2026-01-05 14:58:37', 'mjjr57m99pjjsm8i9mm', 'message', '{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"I can\\u2019t click it for you yet, but here\\u2019s how to do it:\\n\\n- In the Site Editor, look at the header area of the page.\\n- Click once on the site header to select it.\\n- Click directly on the logo image inside the header.\\n- You should see the Logo block toolbar appear.\\n\\nIf you don\\u2019t see the logo, make sure you\\u2019re editing the Header template or Header part.\",\"followup\":\"\",\"pageSuggestion\":\"\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"agent2\",\"name\":\"Design Specialist\",\"role\":\"WordPress Theme Designer\",\"avatar\":\"\"},\"sessionId\":\"bf818aba-b908-4adb-80f6-771fb32f7140\",\"firstSeen\":\"1\"}', 1),
