(120, '2026-01-05 14:58:37', 'mjjr6tekjp87c1c6he', 'message', '{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"I can\\u2019t do this for you yet, but I\\u2019ll guide you.\\n\\nIf you don\\u2019t see a center option after clicking the logo, try this:\\n\\n- Click the **logo**, then click again to select the **Header** or **Row\\/Group** that contains it (you should see a blue outline around the whole area).\\n- Look at the **top toolbar** and choose **Align \\u2192 Center**.\\n- If you don\\u2019t see alignment in the toolbar, open the **right sidebar** (\\u2699\\ufe0f icon).\\n- Under **Layout**, set **Justification** or **Alignment** to **Center**.\\n\\nIf it still won\\u2019t center:\\n- Make sure the logo is inside a **Row** or **Group** block.\\n- Select that Row\\/Group and set its alignment to **Center**.\\n\\nTell me what block name you see selected (Logo, Row, Group, or Header), and I\\u2019ll guide you exactly.\",\"followup\":\"\",\"pageSuggestion\":\"\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"agent2\",\"name\":\"Design Specialist\",\"role\":\"WordPress Theme Designer\",\"avatar\":\"\"},\"sessionId\":\"92382c69-aff4-4c4c-9555-e4d3dcf2da4e\"}', 1),
