ate-time-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:87:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Estimated-Delivery-Time-white-01.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Estimated Delivery Date & Time\";s:4:\"copy\";s:134:\"Display estimated delivery time on your shop, product, cart, and checkout pages. Option to show estimated delivery date by city/state.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:78:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/estimated-delivery-date-time-for-woocommerce/\";}i:11;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:53:\"orders-list-empty-body-universal-address-autocomplete\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:30:\"universal-address-autocomplete\";s:4:\"icon\";s:83:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Icon-Address-Auto-Complete-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Universal Address Autocomplete\";s:4:\"copy\";s:186:\"Stop losing sales at checkout. Universal Address Autocomplete fills in your customers\' addresses in seconds - reducing failed deliveries, support tickets, and cart abandonment in one go.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:64:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/universal-address-autocomplete/\";}i:12;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:52:\"orders-list-empty-body-email-customizer-and-designer\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:29:\"email-customizer-and-designer\";s:4:\"icon\";s:69:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/icon-120x120-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Email Customizer and Designer\";s:4:\"copy\";s:77:\"Create custom emails with an easy drag-and-drop email customizer and builder.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:63:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/email-customizer-and-designer/\";}i:13;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:40:\"orders-list-empty-body-spee-dee-delivery\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:17:\"spee-dee-delivery\";s:4:\"icon\";s:96:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/WooCommerce-spee-dee-dhipping-method-logo.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Spee-Dee Delivery\";s:4:\"copy\";s:85:\"Spee-Dee Delivery Shipping Method for the upper midwest region of the United States.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:51:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/spee-dee-delivery/\";}i:14;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:34:\"orders-list-empty-body-scanventory\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:11:\"scanventory\";s:4:\"icon\";s:68:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/estudios-icon.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:51:\"Scanventory – Inventory Manager & Label Generator\";s:4:\"copy\";s:99:\"Synchronize your warehouse inventory with your WooCommerce store products using your mobile device.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:45:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/scanventory/\";}i:15;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:44:\"orders-list-empty-body-canal-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:21:\"canal-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:81:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Canal_WC_Icon_160x160_v1-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"Canal\";s:4:\"copy\";s:101:\"Sell 3rd party products without taking on inventory risk with Canal’s modern dropshipping solution.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:55:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/canal-for-woocommerce/\";}i:16;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:61:\"orders-list-empty-body-woocommerce-advanced-shipping-packages\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:38:\"woocommerce-advanced-shipping-packages\";s:4:\"icon\";s:96:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/advanced-shipping-packages-icon-160x160-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Advanced Shipping Packages\";s:4:\"copy\";s:79:\"Split your cart into separate packages, with dedicated shipping configurations.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:72:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-advanced-shipping-packages/\";}i:17;a:9