(645, 1, '2026-02-03 10:09:36', '2026-02-03 10:09:36', '<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">1. Tour Overview</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">The <b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b> is a comprehensive 8-hour journey. We combine the rugged history of the 18th-century pearling era with the natural beauty of Qatar’s northern coastline. This tour is designed for travelers who want to see the \"real\" Qatar beyond the city limits.</p>\n\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">2. Experience History on our UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Our first major stop is the <b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Al Zubarah Fort</b>. As a cornerstone of our <b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b>, this site offers a deep dive into the military architecture of the 1930s built upon the remains of a historic coastal town.</p>\n\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What you’ll see:</b> Original archaeological excavations, the iconic four towers, and a museum detailing Qatar\'s global trade history.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">External Resource:</b> Learn more about the <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwiTm63AzrySAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ4QY\">UNESCO World Heritage criteria for Al Zubarah</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">3. The Haunting Beauty of Al Jumail Ghost Town</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">No <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b> is complete without a visit to the \"Ghost Town\" of Al Jumail. This abandoned village provides a stark, beautiful contrast to the restored fort.</p>\n\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Photography:</b> This is the best spot in the country for \"ruin photography.\"</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">History:</b> See the remains of traditional limestone houses and the village mosque where families lived before the oil boom.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\">4. Modern Art in the North: Olafur Eliasson</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">We add a modern twist to your <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b> by visiting the massive mirrors of \"Shadows Travelling on the Sea of the Day.\" Located near Al Zubarah, these circular mirrors reflect the desert floor and the sky, creating a breathtaking optical illusion.</p>\n\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"25\">5. Al Thakhira Mangroves &amp; Purple Island</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">To finish the day, we head to the lush green <b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Al Thakhira Mangroves</b>. This is a stark contrast to the desert sands you explored earlier.</p>\n\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"27\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Wildlife:</b> Look out for flamingos and unique species of crabs.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">History:</b> Visit <b data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">Purple Island</b>, where ancient civilizations produced expensive purple dye from crushed sea snails.</p>\n\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_644\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"300\"]<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-644\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Mangroves-300x215.png\" alt=\"UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar\" width=\"300\" height=\"215\" /> UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar[/caption]</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"29\">6. Why Book With Eyeshot Tourism?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">At <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwiTm63AzrySAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ4gY\">Eyeshot Tourism</a> (Internal Link), we specialize in inbound tours that focus on storytelling and comfort. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b> includes:</p>\n\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"31\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\">Professional licensed guides.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\">Luxury 4x4 or air-conditioned van transport.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\">Traditional Qatari lunch included.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"33\">7. Important Information</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"34\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration:</b> 8–9 Hours.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Attire:</b> Conservative clothing is recommended for heritage sites.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pick-up:</b> Available from all Doha hotels and the Hamad International Airport.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Submit a booking enquiry to customize your tour!</strong></h3>\n[contact-form to=\"tours@eyeshottourism.com\" subject=\"UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar & Ancient Ghost Town Expedition: Al Zubarah, Olafur Eliasson, Al Thakhira Mangroves & Al Jumail\"][contact-field label=\"Name\" type=\"name\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"WhatsApp Number (with country code): \" type=\"text\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"How can we help you plan your journey?\" type=\"textarea\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Any Additional Questions? or Call / WhatsApp us +974 6609 4911\" type=\"text\"][/contact-form]\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"34\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34,2,0\"></p>\n</li>\n</ul>', 'UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar & Ancient Ghost Town Expedition: Al Zubarah, Olafur Eliasson, Al Thakhira Mangroves & Al Jumail', '<p data-path-to-node=\"40\"><b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Ultimate Full-Day North Qatar Combo.</b> Experience the <b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">UNESCO Heritage Tour Qatar</b> including Al Zubarah Fort, the Al Jumail Ghost Town, Olafur Eliasson’s desert art, and the lush Al Thakhira Mangroves.</p>\n\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"41\">\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"41,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"41,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Includes:</b> Lunch, Transport, and Expert Guide.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"41,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"41,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Best for:</b> History, Culture, and Photography.</p>\n</li>\n 	<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"41,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"41,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration:</b> Full Day (8 Hours).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '643-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-03 10:09:36', '2026-02-03 10:09:36', '', 643, 'https://eyeshottourism.com/?p=645', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(642, 1, '2026-02-03 09:11:39', '2026-02-03 09:11:39', '', 'Place Vendome A Parisian Masterpiece in Lusail', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'place-vendome-a-parisian-masterpiece-in-lusail', '', '', '2026-02-03 09:12:15', '2026-02-03 09:12:15', '', 636, 'https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Place-Vendome-A-Parisian-Masterpiece-in-Lusail.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
