(501, 1, '2026-01-21 11:57:56', '2026-01-21 11:57:56', '<p data-rm-block-id=\"block-1\">Discover the high‑end side of Qatar with the <strong>Modern Doha Luxury Tour &amp; Lifestyle Experience</strong>. Begin along the <strong>Doha Corniche</strong>, the city’s iconic waterfront promenade with sweeping views of the Arabian Gulf. Continue into <strong>West Bay</strong>, where glittering skyscrapers showcase Doha’s modern skyline.</p>\r\n<p data-rm-block-id=\"block-2\">Next, immerse yourself in art and culture at <strong>Katara Cultural Village</strong>, home to galleries, theaters, and boutique shops. From there, enjoy a luxury drive through <strong>The Pearl‑Qatar</strong>, exploring Porto Arabia’s glamorous marina and the Venetian‑inspired Qanat Quartier.</p>\r\n<p data-rm-block-id=\"block-3\">The journey continues into <strong>Lusail</strong>, Qatar’s city of the future, with highlights such as Lusail Boulevard, Marina, and seasonal attractions like Winter Wonderland. Finally, conclude with a visit to <strong>Al Maha Island</strong> or nearby leisure islands, where entertainment, dining, and panoramic sea views provide the perfect finale to your <strong>Doha Luxury Tour</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-rm-block-id=\"block-4\">This curated experience blends culture, shopping, architecture, and lifestyle, offering travelers a refined glimpse into Qatar’s modern icons. Whether half‑day or full‑day, the <strong>Doha Luxury Tour</strong> is designed for those seeking sophistication and unforgettable memories.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n[caption id=\"attachment_502\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"300\"]<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-502\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Doha-City-300x200.png\" alt=\"Doha Luxury Tour\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /> Modern Doha Luxury Tour &amp; Lifestyle Experience – Corniche, West Bay, Katara, The Pearl, Lusail &amp; Islands[/caption]\r\n<h4 data-rm-block-id=\"block-6\"><strong>Submit a booking enquiry for the Modern Doha Luxury Tour &amp; Lifestyle Experience! </strong></h4>\r\n[contact-form to=\"tours@eyeshottourism.com\" subject=\"Premium 4-Day Qatar Luxury Tour Package (Bespoke Family Special)\"][contact-field label=\"Name\" type=\"name\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"WhatsApp Number (with country code): \" type=\"text\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"How can we help you plan your journey?\" type=\"textarea\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Any Additional Questions? or Call / WhatsApp us +974 6609 4911\" type=\"text\" required=\"1\"][/contact-form]', 'Modern Doha Luxury Tour & Lifestyle Experience', 'Embark on the ultimate <strong>Doha Luxury Tour</strong>, starting at the Corniche and West Bay before exploring Katara Cultural Village, The Pearl‑Qatar, Lusail, and nearby islands. A refined journey of art, architecture, shopping, and lifestyle.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'modern-doha-luxury-tour-lifestyle', '', '', '2026-02-02 08:37:28', '2026-02-02 08:37:28', '', 0, 'https://eyeshottourism.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=501', 0, 'product', '', 0),
