(389, 1, '2025-12-25 06:06:28', '2025-12-25 06:06:28', '<h1>Full 6 Day Qatar Tour Packages and logistics</h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"entry-header\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The Ultimate Luxury &amp; Adventure Journey in Qatar- Full 6 Day Qatar Tour\r\n</strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Experience the Majesty, Culture, and Thrill with All-Inclusive Bespoke Services</strong></h2>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trip-post-content\">\r\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"5\">Experience the majesty, culture, and thrill of Qatar with our signature all-inclusive 6 day Qatar tour package. Designed for discerning travelers and families, this journey seamlessly blends bespoke luxury, curated cultural immersion, and exhilarating desert and coastal adventures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"5\">Forget the logistics; from the moment you arrive, your 24/7 Personal Concierge handles every detail, ensuring an unforgettable and effortless exploration of one of the world’s most dynamic destinations.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"6\"><strong>Focusing on the cost and experience:</strong> For<strong> $2,700 USD per family</strong> (2 Adults and infants) this high-end package provides a worry-free experience; a $100 USD surcharge may apply for children, depending on the extra services requested.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"6\"><strong>Flexible Itinerary &amp; Bespoke Adjustments</strong>\r\n​We understand that the best travel moments are often unplanned. Your 6-day package includes a completely flexible schedule.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"6\"><strong>​Personalized Adjustments:</strong> If you wish to spend more time at a specific location or skip a planned activity, simply let your concierge know to refund related payments and reschedule.\r\n<strong>Fair Pricing &amp; Activity Credits: </strong>Your package is designed to be as flexible as your travel plans. We believe you should only pay for what you experience.\r\n​<strong>Skip and Save:</strong> If you choose to remove a major activity from your itinerary, we will reduce the package price by a fixed credit amount.\r\n​<strong>Always Available:</strong> We will be personally available throughout your 6 Day Qatar Tour stay to adjust logistics, timings, and activities in real-time to suit your needs.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"6\"><strong>Want more thrills and VIP Access?</strong> You can easily add some world-class attractions to your itinerary during checkout.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"6\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Day Title Experience Summary</strong></span></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 1:</strong> Evening Arrival &amp; Welcome to Qatar Premium Airport Transfer, check-in to Bespoke Accommodation. Introduction to your 24/7 Personal Concierge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-151\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/1764154724420-264x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"299\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-152\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/1764155257454-273x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"273\" height=\"300\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-243\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-04-12-50-05-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-2-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"299\" /></h1>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 2:</strong> Doha City Exploration Full-day Doha City Tour, including Souq Waqif, MIA, Katara Cultural Village, and an experience of Fine Dining and Retail Passages.\r\n<a href=\"https://www.fanar.qa/en/news\">https://www.fanar.qa/en/news</a></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-147\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/2025-11-26-10-04-37-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-144\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/2025-11-26-08-50-50-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-5-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-169\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/1764160579883-300x187.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"318\" height=\"198\" /></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 3:</strong> Desert Adventure Base Exhilarating 4×4 Dune Bashing, Camel Ride, and a visit to the UNESCO site of the Inland Sea (Khor Al Adaid).</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-254\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-08-06-58-36-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-3-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-238\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-04-11-56-35-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-1-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-257\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-08-06-58-36-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-6-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 4:</strong> Aquatic Escape at Banana Island VIP luxury boat transfer to Banana Island for a full day of resort activities, pool, beach, and leisure.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-235\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-04-11-09-20-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-2-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-153\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/1764155719875-273x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"273\" height=\"300\" /></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 5:</strong> Cultural Heritage &amp; North Qatar Guided tour of Al Zubarah Fort (UNESCO Heritage Site), Al Khor fishing harbor, and the Al Thakhira Mangroves.\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-248\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1764855399169-1-164x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"371\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-234\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-04-11-09-20-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-1-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"369\" /></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><strong>Day 6:</strong> Private Dhow Cruise &amp; Skyline Sunset Private Dhow Cruise at sunset over the illuminated Doha Skyline, complete with BBQ dinner and music.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-237\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2025-12-04-11-56-35-8b3dd4b0-764d-4031-8d1f-323a586231f3-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"235\" height=\"353\" />\r\n<strong>Day 7:</strong> Departure Day Private airport drop-off (Premium Airport Transfer) to Hamad International Airport.</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"15\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-40\" src=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Final-3D-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"233\" height=\"233\" /></p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"16\"><strong>What’s Included in Your Final Package Price:</strong>\r\nPrivate transportation throughout your journey during the 6 Day Qatar Tour.\r\nAccommodation for 6 nights.\r\nDaily full day guided activities and tours listed in the itinerary.\r\nBanana Island Day-Pass with Luxury Lunch and Boat Transfers.\r\nDaily lunch, water, and refreshments included during all full-day tours.\r\nAll entry fees, permits, and taxes included.\r\nProfessional tour guides, Personalized adjustments &amp; Always Available</p>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"16\"><a href=\"https://eyeshottourism.com/shop/\">Book Your Tour - Eyeshot Tourism | Curating Elite Qatar Escapes</a></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-extendify-agent-block-id=\"16\"><strong>Submit a booking enquiry.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"trip-post-content\">\r\n\r\n[contact-form to=\"tours@eyeshottourism.com\" subject=\"Your Luxury Qatar Escape: Let\'s Design Your 6-Day Journey\"][contact-field label=\"Name\" type=\"name\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"WhatsApp Number (with country code): \" type=\"text\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"How can we help you plan your journey?\" type=\"textarea\" required=\"1\"][contact-field label=\"Any Additional Questions? or Call / WhatsApp us +974 6609 4911\" type=\"text\"][/contact-form]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'The Grand Tour- Full 6 Day Qatar Tour Packages and logistics', '<strong>Focusing on the cost and experience:</strong> For<strong> $2,700 USD per family</strong> (2 Adults and infants) this high-end package provides a worry-free experience\r\n\r\n<strong>Seamless Logistics:</strong> Includes Premium Airport Transfers and private transportation throughout.\r\n<strong>Exclusive Accommodation:</strong> Stay in handpicked, Bespoke Accommodation\r\n<strong>Comprehensive Coverage:</strong> This is an all-inclusive offer covering daily tours, entry fees, water, and private transfers.\r\n<strong>100% Flexible Schedule and Personalized Service: </strong>Adjust your daily plan on the go with your dedicated concierge and Benefit from a 24/7 Personal Concierge to assist with any request or reservation during your stay.\r\n\r\n<strong>Fair Pricing &amp; Activity Credits: </strong>Your package is designed to be as flexible as your travel plans. We believe you should only pay for what you experience.\r\n<strong>Aquatic Escape: </strong>A full, luxurious day trip to Banana Island Resort by Anantara.\r\n<strong>True Adventure:</strong> A thrilling Desert Safari that takes you deep into the dunes to the stunning Inland Sea (Khor Al Adaid).\r\n<strong>Want more thrills and VIP Access?</strong> You can easily add these world-class attractions to your itinerary during checkout.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', '6-day-qatar-tour-package-and-logistics', '', '', '2026-01-21 11:44:07', '2026-01-21 11:44:07', '', 0, 'https://eyeshottourism.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=389', 0, 'product', '', 0),
