 in Qatar. Could you provide more details on your current packages?\",\"openInNewTab\":true,\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-whatsapp-button aligncenter is-color-dark\"><a class=\"whatsapp-block__button\" href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=97466094911&amp;text=Hi%20Eyeshot%20Tourism!%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20booking%20a%20tour%20in%20Qatar.%20Could%20you%20provide%20more%20details%20on%20your%20current%20packages%3F\" style=\"background-color:#25D366;color:#fff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chat with us</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/whatsapp-button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/send-a-message --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"About Us\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#dddddd\"},\"dimensions\":{\"minHeight\":\"0px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" id=\"about\" style=\"background-color:#dddddd;min-height:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":0,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#dddddd\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.58,\"y\":0.61},\"minHeight\":50.1,\"minHeightUnit\":\"vh\",\"contentPosition\":\"center center\",\"isDark\":false,\"metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"gallery\"],\"patternName\":\"core/fullscreen-cover-image-gallery\",\"name\":\"Fullscreen cover image gallery\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"